Strix: the Tyto page
https://github.com/SootyOwl/hexo-strix
Copyright (c) 2026 SootyOwl

playsix: the Six theme
https://github.com/CixMango/Six
Copyright (c) 2026 CixMango

Tailwind CSS: the HDS page
https://github.com/tailwindlabs/tailwindcss
Copyright (c) Tailwind Labs, Inc.

The engine session every bot speaks follows the htttx bot protocol, under
the MIT License; the contract mirrors its schemas' field names and bounds,
and the Bot API copies its schema block verbatim.
https://github.com/hex-tic-tac-toe/htttx-bot-api
Copyright (c) 2026 hex-tic-tac-toe

The rating system is Glicko-2, Mark Glickman's published method.
https://www.glicko.net/glicko/glicko2.pdf

How the site works, the rating settings, and the name rule take ideas and
parameter values from lichess.
https://lichess.org

The wordmark font is a subset of Chakra Petch, under the SIL Open Font
License 1.1; its text is apps/web/public/fonts/chakra-petch-OFL.txt.
https://github.com/m4rc1e/Chakra-Petch
Copyright 2018 The Chakra Petch Project Authors

